notes: "These are the views around the canvas. Browse groups pages by Section and shows the stable Slide ID under each thumbnail. Outline is a reading view: title, a short Story summary, and the ID, so I can check the argument before opening a page. Sections edits the shared chapter structure; Notes gives a wide page for the talk; History is per page. They are peer views over one Main deck, not separate documents. The captures are from the public example project."
